WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:07.603
"Ahh!" Roxy flew straight up. [i@Crash!@i]

2
00:00:07.604 --> 00:00:10.845
Below her, the cars smashed into each other.

3
00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:15.771
"You think you're fast, huh?" Magda snapped her fingers.

4
00:00:15.772 --> 00:00:21.018
A washing machine shot toward Roxy.

5
00:00:21.019 --> 00:00:23.575
[i@Pow!@i] Roxy punched it.

6
00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:26.529
The washing machine flew back down at Magda.

7
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:30.000
Magda pretended to be scared. "Oh no!

8
00:00:30.001 --> 00:00:32.989
I hope I don't get hurt!"

9
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.828
Then she laughed.

10
00:00:36.829 --> 00:00:38.661
Magda held up her hand.

11
00:00:38.662 --> 00:00:41.377
The washing machine slowed down and stopped.

12
00:00:41.378 --> 00:00:43.916
She smiled as it floated in the air.

13
00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:47.810
When she dropped her hand, the appliance landed in front of her.

14
00:00:47.811 --> 00:00:51.160
"Wow," Roxy thought. "How does she . . . ?"

15
00:00:51.161 --> 00:00:53.141
A shadow passed over her.

16
00:00:53.142 --> 00:00:56.491
Roxy looked up as a huge truck shot down.

17
00:00:56.492 --> 00:01:02.470
"Yikes!" Roxy zoomed up and grabbed the truck.

18
00:01:02.471 --> 00:01:05.670
Magda threw a car on top of the truck.

19
00:01:05.671 --> 00:01:12.287
Then she threw another.

20
00:01:12.288 --> 00:01:15.527
Roxy's arms shook from the tremendous weight.

21
00:01:15.528 --> 00:01:20.022
"Yawn. This is so easy," Magda said.

22
00:01:20.023 --> 00:01:24.193
"I thought a battle with you would be more challenging."

23
00:01:24.194 --> 00:01:29.803
"Grr!" Roxy used her super strength and tossed the pile of cars away.

24
00:01:29.804 --> 00:01:34.061
[i@Crash!@i] They landed on top of some rusty old cars.

25
00:01:34.062 --> 00:01:38.671
"Nice, Rocket Girl!" Magda laughed.

26
00:01:38.672 --> 00:01:42.718
"This is starting to get a little less boring."

27
00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:44.946
Magda raised her arms.

28
00:01:44.947 --> 00:01:48.410
Metal objects lifted off the ground and surrounded her.

29
00:01:48.411 --> 00:01:52.172
They began to fit themselves together.

30
00:01:52.173 --> 00:01:55.139
"What is she doing now?" Roxy thought.

31
00:01:55.140 --> 00:02:01.205
"Whoa! She's making a suit of armor from that junk!"

32
00:02:01.206 --> 00:02:04.774
"You're pretty powerful, Rocket Girl," Magda said.

33
00:02:04.775 --> 00:02:07.775
"But not as powerful as I am.

34
00:02:07.776 --> 00:02:12.636
I can control metal with my magnetic powers."

35
00:02:12.637 --> 00:02:15.925
She charged at Roxy.

36
00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:19.608
[i@Whiz-hoo!@i] Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

37
00:02:19.609 --> 00:02:22.112
They bounced off the metal.

38
00:02:22.113 --> 00:02:24.845
[i@Bam!@i] Magda crashed into Roxy.

39
00:02:24.846 --> 00:02:27.794
The two of them tumbled into a pile of scrap metal.

40
00:02:27.795 --> 00:02:29.639
They kept fighting.

41
00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.064
Magda shot metal cans at Roxy.

42
00:02:32.065 --> 00:02:36.920
[i@Clang!@i] Roxy hit Magda's armor.

43
00:02:36.921 --> 00:02:39.475
Finally Roxy dropped her fists.

44
00:02:39.476 --> 00:02:43.114
"Your armor is falling apart, Magda," she said.

45
00:02:43.115 --> 00:02:44.876
"You need to give up."

46
00:02:44.877 --> 00:02:47.965
"No way!" Magda grinned.

47
00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:51.192
"This is too much fun!"

48
00:02:51.193 --> 00:02:53.856
Magda raised her arms over her head.

49
00:02:53.857 --> 00:02:56.796
A tall stack of cars beside her wobbled.

50
00:02:56.797 --> 00:03:00.006
She brought her arms down fast.

51
00:03:00.007 --> 00:03:04.046
Roxy leaped out of the way as the cars crashed down on Magda.

52
00:03:04.047 --> 00:03:06.313
"Yikes!" Roxy cried.

53
00:03:06.314 --> 00:03:08.573
"Are you okay, Magda?"

54
00:03:08.574 --> 00:03:10.445
Roxy used her super hearing.

55
00:03:10.446 --> 00:03:12.406
She heard Magda breathing.

56
00:03:12.407 --> 00:03:15.250
Then she heard the metal bend and twist.

57
00:03:15.251 --> 00:03:20.307
The pile of cars moved . . . and stood up!

58
00:03:20.308 --> 00:03:26.858
Roxy gasped. "Whoa! That looks like a giant robot!"

59
00:03:26.859 --> 00:03:30.953
Magda was sitting inside it!

